# # Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

## Flow Diagram (Mermaid)

    ```mermaid
    flowchart TD
    A[Provide filename] --> B{File type supported?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Convert Business Requirement Documents]
    B -->|No| D[Error: File type not supported]
    C --> E[Generate Functional Requirement Documents]
    D --> F[End]
    E --> G[Structured, implementation-ready FRD]
    F --> H[Exit]
    G --> I[Proceed with SCD2 Implementation]
    H --> J[End]
    I --> K[SCD2 Implementation]
    J --> L[End]
    ```


